# Tyrrell026S: XFOIL-sharpened trailing-edge CFD variant of the Tyrrell 026 main element
# (NOT the tested blunt trailing edge, which is 0.007c thick). Orientation as listed: the table is the alpha = 3.6 deg
# listing, with positive incidence = leading edge toward the ground; suction side y < 0 (ground side); LE (0,0), TE (1, 0.0603).
# Source: E. Genua, "A CFD Investigation into Ground Effect Aerodynamics", MSc thesis, TU Delft, July 2009,
#   paper 1 Table 1 (printed page 11 of 13; PDF page 13). https://repository.tudelft.nl/file/File_ec8400ef-f0a8-48d5-9c67-f266aa15a07b
# Original profile: J. Zerihan, PhD thesis, Univ. of Southampton, 2001 (chord 223.4 mm). Reproduced as numbers only.
# columns: x/c_suction  y/c_suction  x/c_pressure  y/c_pressure
